  "explanations": {
    "1": "'半'表示时间点的一半，常用于时间表达。",
    "2": "'先'强调顺序，表示最先做的事情。",
    "3": "'和'连接并列的两个名词。",
    "4": "'前'是方位名词，表示位置在前面。",
    "5": "'上'作为动词，表示参加课程。",
    "6": "'什么'是疑问代词，用于询问具体内容。",
    "7": "'一起'是协同副词，表示共同行动。",
    "8": "'很'是程度副词，修饰'多'表示数量大。",
    "9": "'还'是关联副词，表示在已有基础上增加。",
    "10": "'跟'是引出对象的介词，表示陪伴。",
    "11": "'一块儿'是协同副词，与'一起'同义。",
    "12": "'非常'是程度副词，强调快乐的程度很深。",
    "13": "'这'是指示代词，指代前文提到的经历。",
    "14": "'也'是关联副词，表示同样的情况。",
    "15": "'真'是程度副词，表示强烈的肯定语气。"
  },
  "translation": "This morning, I get up at 7:30. After getting up, I wash my face first, then go to the kitchen for breakfast. Mom makes eggs and bread, and I drink a glass of milk. At 8:30, I leave for school. The school is in front of my house; I walk to school, which takes fifteen minutes. In the morning, we attend Chinese class; the teacher teaches us various Chinese characters. In the afternoon, my classmate and I go to the library together; there are many books in the library, and we like reading together. In the evening, I go home and do homework; sometimes I also watch TV. On weekends, I go to the park with my friend; we have a great time. This is my greatest happiness. I can also learn many new things. I really like studying."
